Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,An unused import.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A guide that moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Small maintenance chores keep pulling a\Nmaintainer away from the work they meant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,PatchGardener scans this fictional\Nrepository with real tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Each finding comes with a file, a line, and\Na reproducible diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This finding sits under authentication.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It stays visible, but an AI proposal is\Nwithheld.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensitive paths remain in human hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One unused import.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Exact Ruff evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A small review unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The original source is untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Qwen proposes the edit locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Both versions are visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The app limits the file, the patch size, and\Nthe permitted Python change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Removing an import can still have side\Neffects, so the developer reviews the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:01:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The button stays disabled until the\Ndeveloper checks the approval box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That authorizes a separate copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not authorize a commit or a push.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the copied patch earns its result.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,One issue resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero new findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The original stayed unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Existing baseline issues remain visible\Nrather than being hidden behind a green
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.78,0:01:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Expand the actual test output: three fixture\Ntests passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The exported diff also passed Git's\Napplicability check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Export a normal patch and inspect the audit\Ntrail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Four eligible fixture repairs validated in\Nthe measured evaluation, while one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.38,0:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,protected issue was withheld.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Less mechanical tending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,More room for the work that matters.
